	<RuntimeModule Name="MajorFactionTheWatcher" Type="Extension" Version="1.3">
		<Tags>MajorFactions</Tags>
		<Author>Klosterheim</Author>
		<Homepage></Homepage>
		<Title>Major Faction - The Watcher</Title>
		<Description>
Introduces a new faction complete with all the bells and whistles you would expect.
At first this faction may seem overpowered, however; 
It is a slow rolling snowball that requires careful management at higher difficulties
Fully functioning with Penumbra DLC, although it is not required. 
Supremacy DLC is required to access Behemoth Technology.

Added Runeless Localization as an option.
Copy the "english" folder located here:
INSTALLPATH- Steam\steamapps\workshop\content\392110\1493351143\RUNELESS
And Paste it in here, replacing the existing file when prompted:
INSTALLPATH- Steam\steamapps\workshop\content\392110\1493351143\Localization
Re-Subscribe to turn the runes back on.

---
Version 1.3:
- Compatible with Penumbra DLC

Version 1.2:
- Runeless Version Added
- Minor Localization Fixes

Version 1.1:
- Ship Texture Additions and Improvements
- Completed Behemoth GuiElements
- Completed Ark GuiElements
- Completed Quest Lore
- Minor Localization Fixes 

Version 1.0:
- Custom GUI Elements, Images and Textures
- Endless Runes for Lore-Specific Elements

- Unique Faction (The Watcher)
- Unique Affinity (Horatio/Riftborn Hybrid)
- Unique Population (Constructs)
- Unique Home Planet (Arcadia)
- Unique Hero (Prime Construct)
- Customized Ship Textures (White/Gold Vodyani and Behemoths)
- Customized Ship Modules (Non-Essence Vodyani Base)
- Customized Quests (Vodyani Base)
---

Suggested Mods:
White Heroes by Jaylo:
https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1167782728

Known Issues:
- Overwrites Vodyani Ship Textures
- "Introduction" Voiceline is based on most recent DLC installed.
- Questline spawns a second "Tabernacle" System when against a Vodyani opponent
(The correct system is usually the Second, use the button in the top right to navigate)
		</Description>

